    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A VARIETY OF BULLETS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Monster Bullets each monster type has a unique weakness. Become a gun slinging monster hunter and master the art of reading a situation and loading the right bullet for each monster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GONZO MONSTERS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>From radio entities that get inside your head to space spiders with hallucinogenic venom, encounter a wide range of creative and novel monsters. Complete your bestiary and uncover strategies and lore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Multiplayer Coop</strong><br>Monster Bullets is built and balanced with single-player in mind but that doesn't mean you can't play with up to 5 friends!<br></li><li> <strong>Procedural Maps</strong><br>Navigate catacombs, forests, caves, and more in Monster Bullets. All layouts are procedurally generated to ensure that each run is different from the last!<br></li><li> <strong>Speed Running Timer</strong><br>Compete with your friends to see who can delve into the dungeon depths and slay the goblin king the fastest!<br></li><li> <strong>Endless Mode</strong><br>After slaying the goblin king, you can test your endurance and see how long you can make it in endless mode!<br></li><li> <strong>Gonzo Monsters</strong><br>Over 24 varied monsters from shapeshifting skinwalkers to lumbering trolls!<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Upgrades</strong><br>Over 24 upgrades with novel interactions for different monster archetypes.</li></ul> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A VARIETY OF BULLETS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/c14922366057e2a31047f44bbd5aef78.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Monster Bullets each monster type has a unique weakness. Become a gun slinging monster hunter and master the art of reading a situation and loading the right bullet for each monster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GONZO MONSTERS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/be31a1551fa9b1ed276d4c397a97bca6.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>From radio entities that get inside your head to space spiders with hallucinogenic venom, encounter a wide range of creative and novel monsters. Complete your bestiary and uncover strategies and lore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Multiplayer Coop</strong><br>Monster Bullets is built and balanced with single-player in mind but that doesn't mean you can't play with up to 5 friends!<br></li><li> <strong>Procedural Maps</strong><br>Navigate catacombs, forests, caves, and more in Monster Bullets. All layouts are procedurally generated to ensure that each run is different from the last!<br></li><li> <strong>Speed Running Timer</strong><br>Compete with your friends to see who can delve into the dungeon depths and slay the goblin king the fastest!<br></li><li> <strong>Endless Mode</strong><br>After slaying the goblin king, you can test your endurance and see how long you can make it in endless mode!<br></li><li> <strong>Gonzo Monsters</strong><br>Over 24 varied monsters from shapeshifting skinwalkers to lumbering trolls!<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Upgrades</strong><br>Over 24 upgrades with novel interactions for different monster archetypes.</li></ul> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
